+### 2.1 Golden 8-Satellite Topology (Post-Consolidation Architecture)
+
+Following the federation optimization and Render deployment consolidation (commits `8d218619`, `8465421e`), the active topology consists of 8 primary repositories. Six decommissioned satellite transit surfaces have been merged into `supremeai-api` and `supremeai-vscode`:
+
+| Repository | Topology Tier | Role & Architecture Boundary |
+|---|---|---|
+| **supremeai-open** | Public SSOT | Public ingress, task hub, PR bridge, and open front door |
+| **supremeai** | Core Moat | Umbrella monorepo, gates, and constitutional governance (Admin-only) |
+| **supremeai-api** | Backend Engine | Unified provider gateway, MCP control plane, agents lifecycle, command bot, and skills |
+| **supremeai-studio** | Web UI Portal | Pure React/Vite web dashboard, admin portal, and viewer console (Vercel) |
+| **supremeai-vscode** | Native Client Hub | VS Code extension, Tauri 2 desktop workstation, Capacitor 6 mobile app |
+| **supremeai-browser** | Sandbox Engine | Stealth web automation and sandbox execution engine |
+| **supremeai-archive** | Institutional Memory | Append-only worklogs, ADRs, and decision records (Proprietary) |
+| **supremeai-core** | Decision Intelligence | Proprietary reasoning brain and autonomous arbitration (Private) |
+
+*Consolidated Surfaces (Decommissioned as standalone repos):*
+- `supremeai-agents`, `supremeai-command`, `supremeai-infrastructure`, `supremeai-skills`, `supremeai-mcp-control-plane` → consolidated as internal modules within `supremeai-api`.
+- `supremeai-sdk` → packaged directly from shared domain schemas in `supremeai-vscode` and `supremeai-api`.
